  "description_html": "Size comparison of <i>Antineosteus rufus</i>, homostiid placoderm from Czech Republic. Human silhouette is <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Human_outline.svg\" title=\"File:Human outline.svg\">File:Human_outline.svg</a>.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"References\">References</h4></div>\n<ul><li><cite style=\"font-style:normal\">(in English) Vaškaninová, V.; Kraft, P.. \"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.geology.cz/bulletin/contents/art1450\">The largest Lower Devonian placoderm - Antineosteus rufus sp. nov. from the Barrandian area (Czech Republic)</a>\". <i>Bulletin of Geosciences</i>: 635–644. <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_object_identifier\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Digital object identifier\">DOI</a></span>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.3140/bull.geosci.1450\">10.3140/bull.geosci.1450</a>. <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:ISSN\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">ISSN</span></a></span> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.worldcat.org/issn/1802-8225\">1802-8225</a>.</cite></li></ul>\n<p>- Material shape, size.\n</p>\n<ul><li><cite style=\"font-style:normal\">(in English) Rücklin, Martin; Lelièvre, Hervé; Klug, Christian. \"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/328419619_Placodermi_from_the_Early_Devonian_Kess-Kess_Mounds_of_Hamar_Laghdad_Southern_Morocco\">Placodermi from the Early Devonian Kess-Kess Mounds of Hamar Laghdad, Southern Morocco</a>\". <i>Neues Jahrbuch für Geologie und Paläontologie - Abhandlungen</i>: 301–306. <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_object_identifier\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Digital object identifier\">DOI</a></span>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1127/njgpa/2018/0780\">10.1127/njgpa/2018/0780</a>.</cite></li></ul>\n<p>- Skeletal reconstruction.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://muzeum3000.nm.cz/veda/pred-400-miliony-lety-u-nas-zili-giganticti-obratlovci\">http://muzeum3000.nm.cz/veda/pred-400-miliony-lety-u-nas-zili-giganticti-obratlovci</a></li></ul>\n<p>- Placement of material.\n</p>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Homostius2DB.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Homostius2DB.jpg/120px-Homostius2DB.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"113\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Homostius2DB.jpg/250px-Homostius2DB.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1280\" data-file-height=\"1800\"></a></span> By Dmitry Bogdanov, used for reference of body shape",
